THM3876_REDUCTION g=gcd(m,n);r=t^g;M=m/g;N=n/g;gcd(M,N)=1
THM3876_TOWER A=r^M,C=6r^N(1+r^(M+N)),B=2r^(2N)(3+4r^(M+N))
THM3876_NORMALIZATION k[r^M,r^N+r^(M+2N)] has normalization k[r]
THM3876_COLLISION eta=zeta^N,U=r^(M+N)=-1/(eta+1)
THM3876_SAME_TARGET (A,C)(zeta*r)=(A,C)(r)
THM3876_DIFFERENT_MARK B(zeta*r)-B(r)=-2r^(2N)(eta-1)^3/(eta+1)!=0
THM3876_M1 A=r;forced B descends
THM3876_M2 N odd;S=C/6-A^(N+1)=r^N;forced B descends
THM3876_MGE3 forced B does not descend;no polynomial carrier profile
THM3876_IFF forced marked value descends iff reduced exponent M<=2
THM3876_REPLAY_UNIVERSE universal identities;M<=16,N<=12;coprime_Mge3_pairs=102
THM3876_SCOPE two-exponent monomial marked-root tower only;general singular A1 normalization open
